'''Biohazard''' (バイオハザード, ''Baio Hazādo'', '''Biohazard''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]].

==Effect==
Research Power UP (Sm): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 26 frames (0.87 sec).

