==Trivia==
*This combo and the involved cats may be a reference to the ''[[wikipedia:Resident Evil|Resident Evil]]'' survival horror franchise, where players are tasked with fending off heavily mutated "zombies", mainly via excessive use of weapons. This is further supported by ''Resident Evil''<nowiki/>'s Japanese name being ''Biohazard''.

